{"3964030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Soul Maze", "steam_appid": 3964030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round, your team can fail. Every failure means a vote. Every vote means one of you burns, and comes back as the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Soul Maze</i> is a 2–4 player online co-op where cooperation and betrayal go hand in hand.</strong> Explore a procedurally generated labyrinth, collect Soul Fragments, and survive the darkness. Together, if you can stay that way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>  </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964030/extras/2ad50a9f06fd0a0ed477bfd9dae200ea.poster.avif?t=1786351049\" aria-label=\"Cooperate\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964030/extras/2ad50a9f06fd0a0ed477bfd9dae200ea.webm?t=1786351049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964030/extras/2ad50a9f06fd0a0ed477bfd9dae200ea.mp4?t=1786351049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The maze reshapes itself every run: new corridors, new traps, new threats. Work together to locate the Soul Fragments hidden in puzzles and obstacle challenges before time runs out. Every second counts. Every fragment matters. You will never walk the same darkness twice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964030/extras/59bd12f8533df13f808a52be92d978bc.poster.avif?t=1786351049\" aria-label=\"Strategy\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964030/extras/59bd12f8533df13f808a52be92d978bc.webm?t=1786351049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964030/extras/59bd12f8533df13f808a52be92d978bc.mp4?t=1786351049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you noticed the tall tower rising from the center of the maze? It might just save you. From there, one player can oversee the labyrinth, guiding others through the darkness and locating the fragments. Use it wisely… or ignore it at your own risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964030/extras/43b01e28b69868de7881400a5c18e14b.poster.avif?t=1786351049\" aria-label=\"Challenges\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964030/extras/43b01e28b69868de7881400a5c18e14b.webm?t=1786351049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964030/extras/43b01e28b69868de7881400a5c18e14b.mp4?t=1786351049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soul Fragments aren't just lying around. They're locked behind obstacle courses, solo puzzles, and cooperative trials that demand communication and trust. The maze will test both, and so will your teammates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964030/extras/b2908602d59003ad745ba74fa7700365.poster.avif?t=1786351049\" aria-label=\"Vengeance\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964030/extras/b2908602d59003ad745ba74fa7700365.webm?t=1786351049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964030/extras/b2908602d59003ad745ba74fa7700365.mp4?t=1786351049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sacrificed by your friends? The maze has other plans for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Dark Soul, you return with new powers and one objective : make sure they never escape. Steal fragments before the light souls reach them. Use your XRay vision to track them through walls. Freeze them in place and watch them scramble. You're no longer playing the same game, you're playing against it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more rounds they fail, the more Dark Souls hunt them. By the final round, the odds might not be in their favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2–4 Player Online Co-Op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vote &amp; Sacrifice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asymmetric Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity Voice Chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural Maze</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trials &amp; Challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Lantern Powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpredictable Global Effects</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round, your team can fail. Every failure means a vote. Every vote means one of you burns, and comes back as the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Soul Maze</i> is a 2–4 player online co-op where cooperation and betrayal go hand in hand.</strong> Explore a procedurally generated labyrinth, collect Soul Fragments, and survive the darkness. Together, if you can stay that way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>  </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964030/extras/2ad50a9f06fd0a0ed477bfd9dae200ea.poster.avif?t=1786351049\" aria-label=\"Cooperate\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964030/extras/2ad50a9f06fd0a0ed477bfd9dae200ea.webm?t=1786351049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964030/extras/2ad50a9f06fd0a0ed477bfd9dae200ea.mp4?t=1786351049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The maze reshapes itself every run: new corridors, new traps, new threats. Work together to locate the Soul Fragments hidden in puzzles and obstacle challenges before time runs out. Every second counts. Every fragment matters. You will never walk the same darkness twice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964030/extras/59bd12f8533df13f808a52be92d978bc.poster.avif?t=1786351049\" aria-label=\"Strategy\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964030/extras/59bd12f8533df13f808a52be92d978bc.webm?t=1786351049\" ty